  "worked_solution": "The matrices $B$ and $C$ are upper triangular matrices since all the entries below the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nThe matrix $A$ is *not* an upper triangular matrix since it has a non-zero element below the main diagonal: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{43} & =1\\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$",
